WEBVTT

00:06.880 --> 00:07.920
Hold it right there!

00:12.670 --> 00:14.670
Behold, the tri-color wind that sparks miracles!

00:15.250 --> 00:18.170
Magical Girl Miracle Mimiru!

00:18.380 --> 00:20.130
It's miracle time!

00:21.080 --> 00:24.250
Your rampage ends here, villain!

00:24.880 --> 00:25.960
Out of my way!

00:26.500 --> 00:27.790
I don't think so!

00:29.330 --> 00:30.420
Is that all you've got?!

00:39.290 --> 00:43.500
Mimiru, she's too strong! You should retreat!

00:43.500 --> 00:44.330
Never!

00:44.670 --> 00:47.710
I'm the magical girl who keeps this town safe!

00:48.500 --> 00:51.250
I'll never run away from a fight!

00:53.830 --> 00:57.000
She was never afraid, never gave up...

00:57.580 --> 01:00.420
That courage captivated me.

01:01.540 --> 01:03.710
You can do it! You can do it!

01:03.710 --> 01:05.330
That was how it all started.

01:03.710 --> 01:11.460
You can do it! You can do it! You can do it! You can do it!

01:06.250 --> 01:10.540
That moment sparked my obsession with magical girls.

01:23.630 --> 01:24.500
Cho cute

01:25.960 --> 01:26.670
Touching

01:28.960 --> 01:29.790
Cho cool

01:31.000 --> 01:31.750
Charming

01:40.000 --> 01:45.290
Taiyo mitai ni sunny pikari kagayaiteru

01:45.290 --> 01:50.630
Nikori egao ga smiley suteki tsuyoi kimochi

01:50.790 --> 01:56.040
Dakedo namida mo teary horori koboreru no ga

01:56.170 --> 02:00.960
Kawaii dake janai miryoku

02:01.330 --> 02:06.540
Ima wa tada sora o miageru watashi no

02:06.710 --> 02:14.750
Kokoro ni mebaeta atarashii chikara o shinjiru no

02:14.880 --> 02:17.330
Akogareru dake janakute

02:17.580 --> 02:19.960
Yume ni miru dake janakute

02:20.130 --> 02:22.750
Naritai kawaritai

02:22.920 --> 02:25.420
Suki ga watashi no minamoto

02:25.710 --> 02:31.880
Hitomi no oku ga ubawareteshimatta hi kara

02:31.880 --> 02:38.420
Zutto iroasenai My Dream Girls

02:38.710 --> 02:39.670
Cho cute

02:41.000 --> 02:41.790
Touching

02:44.080 --> 02:44.920
Cho cool

02:46.080 --> 02:46.920
Charming

02:51.330 --> 02:54.670
Our town is protected by a team of magical girls.

02:51.670 --> 02:54.710
<b>Azure in Trouble!</b>

02:55.290 --> 02:57.960
The Tres Magia do battle against evil.

02:58.880 --> 03:04.080
Magia Magenta is energetic, innocent,
and always inspires the trio to give it their all.

03:05.420 --> 03:08.330
Magia Sulfur is graceful and ladylike...

03:09.460 --> 03:13.880
...or so I thought, before I found out she's tough
and always up for a fight.

03:14.920 --> 03:20.670
Magia Azure is cool and refined,
the kind of woman every girl dreams of becoming.

03:22.330 --> 03:24.000
At least, that's how it's supposed to be...

03:27.290 --> 03:28.290
Stop, please!

03:31.750 --> 03:32.920
Azure!

03:32.920 --> 03:35.080
What the hell?! Get your shit together!

03:35.420 --> 03:38.290
I-I'm trying, but...

03:40.580 --> 03:42.670
She's getting way too easy to catch...

03:44.080 --> 03:47.790
She seemed to put up more of a fight before...

03:48.500 --> 03:50.460
So what's wrong with her now?

03:52.580 --> 03:55.080
A..Alice-chan, don't look!

04:00.080 --> 04:02.880
Okay, that's.... enough bullshit!

04:06.040 --> 04:07.460
Way to ruin it.

04:15.710 --> 04:17.540
Sayo-chan, you okay?

04:17.920 --> 04:19.670
Yeah, I'm sorry...

04:20.380 --> 04:22.170
It's cool, we're not mad or anything!

04:22.630 --> 04:27.210
You used to fight way harder than this. What's going on?

04:28.670 --> 04:29.580
I'm sorry.

04:29.960 --> 04:31.750
Sorry's not an explanation, babe.

04:31.960 --> 04:36.830
Kaoruko-chan, everyone goes through slumps
now and then. Go easy on her, okay?

04:38.670 --> 04:42.420
Sure, fine. More kicking ass next time, though, yeah?

04:42.750 --> 04:43.420
Yeah...

04:44.170 --> 04:44.960
Bye.

04:51.630 --> 04:55.880
Ugh, she's sooo annoying!

04:55.880 --> 04:58.250
I can't believe Sulfur blew me away like that!

04:58.460 --> 05:03.000
She's so gonna get it next time!
It's gonna hurt! Really hurt!

05:03.000 --> 05:05.290
Y-yeah, I bet...

05:06.170 --> 05:08.790
So, uh, Kiwi-chan...

05:08.790 --> 05:14.630
Oh, right! I'm going on a trip with my family this weekend!

05:15.960 --> 05:19.460
To Okinawa! Apparently they already
reserved the hotel room.

05:19.460 --> 05:25.830
I don't gotta go, but it's already paid for so might as well.

05:26.290 --> 05:27.960
O-oh, yeah?

05:28.670 --> 05:30.080
Please let me go, meow.

05:31.830 --> 05:34.710
Please let me go, meow. I'm stuck, meow.

05:35.130 --> 05:40.250
C'mon, Korisu-chan! Let the robot do its job!

05:40.250 --> 05:42.830
Please let me go, meow. I'm stuck, meow.

05:43.130 --> 05:46.380
Oh, yeah! Why don't you come with, Utena-chan?

05:46.670 --> 05:51.960
No, I couldn't. You go have fun with your family.

05:52.670 --> 05:55.540
Okay, then I'll bring you a present instead!

05:55.750 --> 05:57.330
Cool, thanks.

05:58.830 --> 06:00.790
Are you sleepy, Korisu-chan?

06:02.250 --> 06:04.040
We should head home.

06:04.040 --> 06:05.080
Mmkay!

06:10.210 --> 06:11.130
Sayo-san...

06:11.500 --> 06:12.290
Vatz...

06:13.170 --> 06:15.750
I don't know what's wrong with me.

06:16.790 --> 06:21.250
Kaoruko's right. I haven't been able to focus at all
during our last few battles.

06:22.790 --> 06:26.880
I know I can't keep going on like this,
but I don't know how to snap out of it...

06:28.080 --> 06:34.040
Sayo-san... do you remember the day we met?

06:41.170 --> 06:44.920
You're okay... I've got it. You get to safety!

06:45.330 --> 06:47.750
B-but what about you?

06:47.920 --> 06:51.460
I'll be fine! Go, run! Hurry!

06:52.880 --> 06:54.330
Don't you dare think about chasing her!

06:56.170 --> 06:58.670
I'm scared. I'm so scared!

07:00.250 --> 07:02.080
What the hell's wrong with you?

07:02.960 --> 07:06.630
She's just a little girl! I won't let you hurt her!

07:11.170 --> 07:12.040
I've got you!

07:22.670 --> 07:28.540
Magical Girl Magia Magenta is on the scene!
And all that jazz.

07:29.880 --> 07:31.380
Thank you so much!

07:32.130 --> 07:34.460
Please, it's no biggie!

07:36.040 --> 07:39.040
So monsters are popping up in our city, too...

07:39.580 --> 07:41.040
Yeah, they are.

07:41.420 --> 07:43.000
On that note...

07:43.580 --> 07:47.960
Would you like to join us and become a magical girl?

07:48.290 --> 07:49.920
M-me?!

07:50.540 --> 07:55.210
Magia Magenta's the only magical girl
keeping your town safe.

07:55.710 --> 07:59.790
You had the courage to save that girl
from the monster just now. You'd be perfect!

08:00.080 --> 08:05.130
N-no, I couldn't! I'm not special, I'm just normal!

08:06.210 --> 08:07.080
Sayo-chan!

08:08.920 --> 08:11.500
I'm just normal, too!

08:13.380 --> 08:15.000
Haruka, you're...?!

08:17.000 --> 08:18.290
The cat's out of the bag!

08:18.920 --> 08:22.290
You were so incredible back then, Sayo-san!

08:22.580 --> 08:25.830
You saved that girl and took on a monster all by yourself!

08:26.540 --> 08:31.420
Nowadays, though, you're acting a little, well, different...

08:32.250 --> 08:40.080
But it makes sense. I've stuck you girls
with an incredibly tough job...

08:40.920 --> 08:44.170
Haruka-san and Kaoruko-san are worried about you, too.

08:45.580 --> 08:46.830
They are?

08:47.630 --> 08:51.000
I think you're just having a hard time getting motivated.

08:51.250 --> 08:54.920
Why not take a little time off to rest and relax?

08:55.710 --> 08:58.580
That, or go somewhere for a change of pace?

08:59.250 --> 09:01.210
Just think it over, okay?

09:01.630 --> 09:04.710
I've gotta head out. I'll come see you again soon!

09:05.750 --> 09:06.540
Vatz...

09:28.710 --> 09:31.880
Wh-what are you doing, Sayo?!

09:36.170 --> 09:38.040
Maybe a change of pace would help...

09:41.290 --> 09:45.880
I didn't find the right time to invite her,
and now she's off with her parents on a trip...

09:46.250 --> 09:50.250
<b>MAGICAL GIRL EXHIBITION</b>

09:46.710 --> 09:49.460
Plus she doesn't like magical girls at all...

09:50.710 --> 09:53.880
I wonder what's wrong with Magia Azure.

09:54.750 --> 09:56.500
Did something happen?

09:57.960 --> 09:59.670
Did I push her too far?!

10:04.540 --> 10:06.290
<b>TRES MAGIA:</b>

10:04.540 --> 10:06.290
<b>MAGIA AZURE</b>

10:08.130 --> 10:13.130
Y'know, before, all I did was watch them...

10:14.380 --> 10:17.750
Now I'm talking with them, fighting them...

10:22.790 --> 10:26.040
<b>TRES MAGIA:</b>

10:22.790 --> 10:26.040
<b>MAGIA AZURE</b>

10:22.960 --> 10:25.830
I-I dunno if that's a good thing, or a bad thing...

10:32.960 --> 10:35.790
I'm glad I went out for a walk to clear my head...

10:41.250 --> 10:43.750
...but I haven't been able to enjoy it at all.

10:47.750 --> 10:49.830
Maybe I should just head home.

10:53.880 --> 10:54.920
Utena-san?

10:56.290 --> 10:58.290
Sorry I'm late!

10:58.630 --> 11:00.250
There you are!

11:00.250 --> 11:01.710
Sorry, my bad!

11:01.830 --> 11:03.500
Can you believe this?

11:03.500 --> 11:05.210
I'm so excited!

11:05.210 --> 11:08.170
Um, hey, uh...

11:10.880 --> 11:13.130
What do you think you're doing?

11:14.540 --> 11:19.330
This girl was waiting in line before you. Don't cut in front.

11:20.960 --> 11:22.210
I'm so sorry!

11:22.210 --> 11:22.880
It's okay.

11:22.210 --> 11:23.960
You got way too excited.

11:23.960 --> 11:26.170
Th-thank you, Minakami-san.

11:23.960 --> 11:26.170
I said I was sorry!

11:26.710 --> 11:29.710
Of course. Sorry to make a fuss about it.

11:30.330 --> 11:31.210
No, it's okay.

11:32.290 --> 11:34.040
What's this line for?

11:34.500 --> 11:37.500
I-it's for the Magical Girl Exhibition.

11:37.920 --> 11:42.750
They've got all sorts of photos
and exhibits and limited edition merch...

11:43.380 --> 11:46.630
<b>MAGICAL GIRL EXHIBITION</b>

11:45.670 --> 11:48.170
So, uh, what were you doing, Minakami-san?

11:48.500 --> 11:52.420
I'm just out for a stroll. I was about to head home.

11:53.250 --> 11:54.960
See you at school.

11:54.960 --> 11:56.460
Yeah, see you there.

12:01.130 --> 12:04.880
<b>MAGICAL GIRL EXHIBITION</b>

12:05.830 --> 12:08.960
The Magical Girl Exhibition... Huh.

12:12.420 --> 12:13.460
Wow.

12:25.630 --> 12:28.330
They've got a lot more here than I expected.

12:34.830 --> 12:37.130
Seeing our own stuff is kind of embarrassing...

12:41.580 --> 12:42.750
OMG.

12:45.710 --> 12:49.920
I can't believe they've got all this! I'm in paradise!

12:53.170 --> 12:56.000
It feels like something in me has changed since then...

12:56.460 --> 12:59.670
I was hoping this would
inspire me somehow, but no luck...

13:03.040 --> 13:06.380
Thank you! Next in line, please!

13:07.130 --> 13:12.210
Can I get this, and these,
and also this limited-edition brochure!

13:12.540 --> 13:15.210
Sure, let me get those for you.

13:19.830 --> 13:21.880
I should just head home.

13:25.830 --> 13:28.330
<b>Now Showing:</b>

13:25.830 --> 13:28.330
<b>Fan-Favorite Episodes!</b>

13:25.840 --> 13:28.330
<b>Relive your Childhood!</b>

13:29.250 --> 13:31.670
Fan-favorite episodes?

13:39.790 --> 13:40.710
Hold it right there!

13:45.460 --> 13:47.460
Behold, the tri-color wind that sparks miracles!

13:48.000 --> 13:50.960
Magical Girl Miracle Mimiru!

13:51.210 --> 13:53.130
It's miracle time!

13:53.460 --> 13:57.130
Your rampage ends here, villain!

13:57.580 --> 13:58.790
Out of my way!

13:59.210 --> 14:00.580
I don't think so!

14:02.130 --> 14:03.250
Is that all you've got?!

14:10.170 --> 14:12.670
Mimiru, she's too strong!

14:12.670 --> 14:14.380
You should retreat!

14:14.380 --> 14:15.420
Never!

14:15.500 --> 14:18.670
I'm the magical girl who keeps this town safe!

14:19.290 --> 14:21.830
I'll never run away from a fight!

14:39.170 --> 14:41.710
Get 'er!

14:43.420 --> 14:45.210
Coalesce, tri-color wind!

14:45.460 --> 14:48.250
Trinity Miracle Shot!

14:58.080 --> 15:00.080
<b>MAGIAL GIRL EXHIBITION</b>

15:01.460 --> 15:02.500
I'm in Heaven!

15:04.000 --> 15:05.750
It's all just fiction.

15:06.630 --> 15:08.630
Reality isn't that bright and happy.

15:09.290 --> 15:11.330
Nothing ever goes as well as it does on TV.

15:12.420 --> 15:13.210
Still...

15:14.080 --> 15:15.670
I'm a magical girl.

15:16.830 --> 15:19.250
I'm Magia Azure. I fight the forces of evil!

15:20.290 --> 15:22.420
And I'll triumph over this weakness of mine!

15:27.630 --> 15:28.790
Trans Magia!

15:45.540 --> 15:48.710
Facing me alone today, Magia Baiser?

15:49.130 --> 15:52.630
I am. Disappointed, are you?

15:53.670 --> 15:58.000
Kiwi's on vacation and Korisu-chan is asleep, so...

15:59.130 --> 16:01.040
No, this is perfect.

16:09.000 --> 16:09.880
I put up a barrier.

16:10.380 --> 16:12.380
Now no one will know we're here.

16:12.790 --> 16:17.460
Oh? Were you that desperate
to get some alone time with me?

16:21.380 --> 16:23.460
Please, as-if!

16:25.330 --> 16:28.540
Goodness, you sure are riled up today.

16:30.670 --> 16:31.380
Don't get cocky!

16:34.000 --> 16:36.420
Fine, then, how do you like this?!

16:37.500 --> 16:39.080
FLOWER!

16:46.580 --> 16:48.130
FLOWER!

16:53.380 --> 16:55.920
I told you not to get cocky.

16:56.920 --> 16:58.420
The same goes for you.

16:58.750 --> 17:03.380
You keep charging in like a rampaging bull
instead of paying attention to what's around you.

17:12.080 --> 17:14.580
Whatever will you do now?

17:16.670 --> 17:20.170
This isn't enough... to stop me from beating you!

17:24.380 --> 17:28.670
My, something's really gotten into you today.

17:28.790 --> 17:29.880
Yeah, you're right.

17:30.420 --> 17:33.420
Because today's the day... I put an end to you!

17:44.710 --> 17:45.630
Take your own advice.

17:46.380 --> 17:48.580
You haven't been paying attention to what's around you!

18:01.670 --> 18:02.170
I did it!

18:02.170 --> 18:03.880
You didn't do a thing.

18:22.040 --> 18:24.500
Come now, what's wrong?

18:24.500 --> 18:26.540
You've still got fight in you, don't you?

18:29.130 --> 18:31.460
You had so much enthusiasm today...

18:31.920 --> 18:34.000
...so let me see it!

18:39.290 --> 18:43.170
C'mon. C'mon! C'mon, c'mon, c'mon!

18:44.460 --> 18:45.420
This won't...

18:48.380 --> 18:49.790
This won't break me!

18:51.750 --> 18:54.080
I can still...

19:02.210 --> 19:04.960
C'mon, Azure, honey...

19:07.790 --> 19:10.000
You're not done, are you?

19:10.790 --> 19:13.330
Go on, get up.

19:13.540 --> 19:18.460
Because there's so, so, SO much more
I want to do before I'm done with you!

19:22.580 --> 19:24.420
THAT'S IT!

19:24.580 --> 19:27.080
C'mon, you can do it!

19:32.960 --> 19:36.210
Mistress Baiser...

19:39.000 --> 19:44.750
I can't... I can't anymore.

19:45.250 --> 19:51.920
I'm too weak. I can't beat you, Mistress.

19:52.080 --> 19:57.420
Mistress Baiser, please, more. I need more!

20:08.880 --> 20:10.960
M-Mistress Baiser?

20:11.290 --> 20:14.460
Why are you looking at me like that?

20:14.710 --> 20:16.920
What did I...?

20:19.540 --> 20:21.330
Wipe that disgusting look off your face.

20:21.880 --> 20:25.380
Were you seriously going to let yourself go evil?

20:26.130 --> 20:28.420
The Tres Magia are paragons of justice.

20:28.540 --> 20:33.960
Every little girl looks up to you.
Yet you were really just about to join the villains?

20:34.170 --> 20:35.960
Despicable. Despicable.

20:35.960 --> 20:37.670
Despicable, despicable, despicable!

20:38.420 --> 20:41.290
There's subverting expectations,
then there's THIS bullshit.

20:41.540 --> 20:44.330
You're a hero. Have some dignity.

20:51.540 --> 20:52.540
No...

20:54.380 --> 20:55.380
I didn't...

20:57.250 --> 20:58.330
I didn't...

21:06.920 --> 21:08.290
'Sup, Utena?

21:08.710 --> 21:09.920
Venalita-san...

21:10.630 --> 21:14.080
Let me guess, you're mad I didn't finish her off?

21:14.580 --> 21:17.920
Nah, I don't care. You keep doing your thing.

21:18.460 --> 21:19.500
I will say, though...

21:19.790 --> 21:22.920
That's some real pot calling
the kettle black if I've ever seen it.

21:23.130 --> 21:23.960
Yeah, I know.

21:27.580 --> 21:28.540
Leoparde.

21:29.670 --> 21:30.830
Magia Baiser.

21:32.170 --> 21:33.290
Neroalice.

21:34.630 --> 21:38.500
They are our three newest members.

21:39.080 --> 21:41.790
Yikes, they all look so weak.

21:43.460 --> 21:49.040
That's the best you could do
while we were out hunting magical girls?

21:49.540 --> 21:53.130
Please, Loco, they look like
they'll be more useful than you.

21:53.790 --> 21:54.630
Excuse me?!

21:55.000 --> 21:57.880
Please don't fight...

22:00.170 --> 22:01.420
Pathetic.

22:08.040 --> 22:13.710
Honto wa motto kawaikute motto suteki na watashi de itai kedo

22:13.880 --> 22:16.710
Chotto warui ko nano sorry

22:17.580 --> 22:19.830
Ijiwaru shitai

22:20.130 --> 22:25.750
Toutosa matte yosasugite honto shindoi kami oshi na anata ni

22:25.920 --> 22:32.880
Sasageru ai no katachi tobikiri no togetoge sadistic

22:33.040 --> 22:35.830
Madamada yumemigachi na shojo

22:36.080 --> 22:38.960
Akogareteita no wa shujinkou

22:39.130 --> 22:44.710
Nande watashi wa sou narenai no? Nante ochikonda keredo

22:44.710 --> 22:50.580
Doki tte kizuichatta kanjou mahou ni kakatte daibousou

22:50.710 --> 22:53.670
Benkyou mo nichijou mo te ni tsukanakute

22:53.670 --> 22:56.830
Mousou shichau risou no situation

22:57.000 --> 23:02.210
Bakudan mitai ni asobu no datte

23:02.580 --> 23:08.080
Waruku wa nai no ka mo ne

23:08.080 --> 23:13.750
Honto wa motto kawaikute motto suteki na watashi de itai kedo

23:13.920 --> 23:19.630
Chanto jibun nari no story aruite yukou for me

23:20.000 --> 23:22.170
Ano ko no motto kagayaite

23:22.170 --> 23:25.710
Motto shigekiteki na sugata mitai kara

23:25.920 --> 23:32.960
Uketotte ai no katachi tobikiri no kodawari na fetish

23:36.040 --> 23:40.920
<b>Here Comes the Lord Squad!</b>
